message:
fix(api/security): upgrade AI SDK family to non-vulnerable provider-utils (GHSA-866g-f22w-33x8) (#3786)

Resolves GHSA-866g-f22w-33x8 (uncontrolled resource consumption in
@ai-sdk/provider-utils, affe

🐛 fix(modal): patch regressions from #16212 imperative createModal migration (#16246)

- Inbox agent advanced settings: stop excluding the Opening tab when isInbox;
  combined with prod's enableAgentS

fix: Resolve uuid to ^11.1.1 to patch CVE-2026-41907 (#12541)

Forces transitive uuid copies (8.3.2 via sequelize/bull, 9.0.1 via
@hocuspocus/*) onto the patched 11.1.1, addressing GHSA-w5hq-g745-h8pq
